BAYAREALIKE+J+x    -83.1095       4      0.0018   0.1339   0.0001    0.0000    176.1238

Am I missing something? Am I doing something wrong? The issue does not happen with DEC models and I am doing exactly the same procedure... Have you ever experienced this behaviour?

Thank you very much in advance!

All the best,
Urtzi

