Hi Meng,

I've run into the same problem with kexpmv last week - another way to install it is to load the version from the CRAN archives with the following code (note that you need Rtools and the devtools package installed for this to work)

library(devtools)
install_version("kexpmv", version = "0.0.3", repos = "http://cran.us.r-project.org")

Hope that helps!

All the best,
Seb

